 "steps": [
  {
   "body_html": "<ul class=\"do\"><li>Measure the <b>thickest part</b> of each portion; use the larger size if they share a bag. This schedule covers portions no thicker than <b><span class=\"q\" data-k=\"len\" data-u=\"mm\" data-a=\"38\" data-s=\"0\">38 mm</span></b>.</li><li>Season with salt and bag with olive oil in <b>one layer</b>. Use a gentle vacuum so the fish keeps its shape. For frozen fish, remove the retail wrapping and rebag while still frozen.</li></ul>",
   "heat": null,
   "id": "step-1",
