   "title": "Measure, season and bag",
   "uses_rows": [
    {
     "amount_html": "2 × <span class=\"q\" data-k=\"mass\" data-u=\"g\" data-a=\"150\" data-b=\"180\" data-s=\"0\">150–180 g</span>",
     "name_html": "Salmon portions, pin bones removed"
    },
    {
     "amount_html": "<span class=\"q\" data-k=\"mass\" data-u=\"g\" data-a=\"3\">3 g</span>",
     "name_html": "Fine salt"
    },
    {
     "amount_html": "<span class=\"q\" data-k=\"vol\" data-u=\"tsp\" data-a=\"2\">2 tsp</span>",
     "name_html": "Olive oil"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "body_html": "<ul class=\"do\"><li>Preheat the bath to <b><span class=\"q\" data-k=\"temp\" data-u=\"C\" data-a=\"50\" data-s=\"0\">50 °C</span></b>. Submerge the pouch fully, with water circulating around it. Start timing once the bath recovers its temperature.</li><li><table class=\"mini\"><thead><tr><th>Thickness</th><th>Chilled / thawed</th><th>Frozen (estimate)</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>up to <span class=\"q\" data-k=\"len\" data-u=\"mm\" data-a=\"13\" data-s=\"0\">13 mm</span></td><td>30 min</td><td>45 min</td></tr><tr><td><span class=\"q\" data-k=\"len\" data-u=\"mm\" data-a=\"14\" data-b=\"25\" data-s=\"0\">14–25 mm</span></td><td>40 min</td><td>60 min</td></tr><tr><td><span class=\"q\" data-k=\"len\" data-u=\"mm\" data-a=\"26\" data-b=\"38\" data-s=\"0\">26–38 mm</span></td><td>60 min</td><td>90 min</td></tr></tbody></table></li><li>Round thickness <b>up</b> to the next row. Frozen times are <b>approximate</b>: ChefSteps’ general 50% extra-time guidance applied to its salmon recipe. These are texture timings, <b>not pasteurization times</b>.</li></ul>",
   "heat": {
    "label": "50 °C bath",
    "label_html": "<span><span class=\"q\" data-k=\"temp\" data-u=\"C\" data-a=\"50\" data-s=\"0\">50 °C</span> bath</span>",
