  {
   "body_html": "<ul class=\"do\"><li>Plate gently with lemon and optional dill.</li><li>The centre should be soft and moist, with flakes that separate under light pressure.</li><li>Serve straight away; this low-temperature recipe is not a cook-chill storage method.</li></ul>",
